{"version": "https://jsonfeed.org/version/1", "title": "MiSTer FPGA Documentation (fork with editorial improvements)", "home_page_url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/", "feed_url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/feed_json_updated.json", "description": "MiSTer FPGA is an open source project that aims to recreate various classic computers, game consoles, and arcade machines, using modern hardware.", "icon": "assets/mister_kun_bw.svg", "authors": [{"name": "Kevin Coleman"}], "language": "en", "items": [{"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/mistercompile/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/mistercompile/", "title": "Compiling for MiSTer", "content_html": "<p>MiSTer combines several compiled components: a customized minimal Linux kernel, a bootloader, the Main MiSTer binary written in C++, and cores built on the M...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/developer/mistercompile.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:37:39+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/mra/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/mra/", "title": "Arcade ROMs and MRA Files", "content_html": "<p>This page explains most of the intricacies of the way MiSTer handles ROMs for Arcade systems.</p>\n<h2>MRA Format</h2>\n<p>Because some arcade boards can change games by ...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/developer/mra.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:37:39+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/porting/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/porting/", "title": "Porting Cores", "content_html": "<p>MiSTer uses quite complex hardware, but thanks to open source, developers with different levels of hardware and software knowledge can develop for the platfo...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/developer/porting.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:37:39+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/principles/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/principles/", "title": "Core Development Guidelines", "content_html": "<p>Tips and guidelines for contributing to the MiSTer project.</p>\n<h2>Indent with tabs, not spaces</h2>\n<p>The project convention is tabs; keep indentation consistent wit...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/developer/principles.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:37:39+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/developer/mistercompile/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/developer/mistercompile/", "title": "MiSTer\u5411\u3051\u30b3\u30f3\u30d1\u30a4\u30eb", "content_html": "<p>MiSTer \u306f\u8907\u6570\u306e\u30b3\u30f3\u30d1\u30a4\u30eb\u6e08\u307f\u30b3\u30f3\u30dd\u30fc\u30cd\u30f3\u30c8\u3092\u7d44\u307f\u5408\u308f\u305b\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002\u30ab\u30b9\u30bf\u30de\u30a4\u30ba\u3055\u308c\u305f\u6700\u5c0f\u9650\u306e Linux \u30ab\u30fc\u30cd\u30eb\u3001\u30d6\u30fc\u30c8\u30ed\u30fc\u30c0\u30fc\u3001C++ \u3067\u66f8\u304b\u308c\u305f Main MiSTer \u30d0\u30a4\u30ca\u30ea\u30fc\u3001\u305d\u3057\u3066 VHDL\u3001Verilog\u3001SystemVerilog \u3067 MiSTer \u30d5\u30ec\u30fc\u30e0\u30ef\u30fc\u30af\u4e0a\u306b\u69cb\u7bc9\u3055\u308c\u305f\u30b3\u30a2\u3067\u3059\u3002\u30d5...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/developer/mistercompile.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:37:39+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/developer/mra/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/developer/mra/", "title": "\u30a2\u30fc\u30b1\u30fc\u30c9ROM\u3068MRA\u30d5\u30a1\u30a4\u30eb", "content_html": "<p>\u3053\u306e\u30da\u30fc\u30b8\u3067\u306f\u3001MiSTer \u304c\u30a2\u30fc\u30b1\u30fc\u30c9\u30b7\u30b9\u30c6\u30e0\u306e ROM \u3092\u6271\u3046\u65b9\u6cd5\u306e\u8907\u96d1\u306a\u90e8\u5206\u306e\u307b\u3068\u3093\u3069\u3092\u8aac\u660e\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002</p>\n<h2>MRA \u30d5\u30a9\u30fc\u30de\u30c3\u30c8</h2>\n<p>\u4e00\u90e8\u306e\u30a2\u30fc\u30b1\u30fc\u30c9\u57fa\u677f\u306f\u65b0\u3057\u3044 ROM \u3092\u633f\u3059\u3060\u3051\u3067\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u3092\u5909\u3048\u3089\u308c\u308b\u305f\u3081\u3001RBF \u30d5\u30a1\u30a4\u30eb\u3092\u30e1\u30cb\u30e5\u30fc\u30ea\u30b9\u30c8\u304b\u3089\u5916\u3057\u3001\u4ee3\u308f\u308a\u306b MRA \u30d5\u30a1\u30a4\u30eb\u3092\u30d6\u30e9\u30a6\u30ba\u3059\u308b\u306e\u304c\u7406\u306b\u304b\u306a\u3063\u3066...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/developer/mra.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:37:39+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/developer/porting/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/developer/porting/", "title": "\u30b3\u30a2\u306e\u79fb\u690d", "content_html": "<p>MiSTer \u306f\u304b\u306a\u308a\u8907\u96d1\u306a\u30cf\u30fc\u30c9\u30a6\u30a7\u30a2\u3092\u4f7f\u3063\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u304c\u3001\u30aa\u30fc\u30d7\u30f3\u30bd\u30fc\u30b9\u306e\u304a\u304b\u3052\u3067\u3001\u30cf\u30fc\u30c9\u30a6\u30a7\u30a2\u3068\u30bd\u30d5\u30c8\u30a6\u30a7\u30a2\u306e\u77e5\u8b58\u30ec\u30d9\u30eb\u304c\u7570\u306a\u308b\u958b\u767a\u8005\u3067\u3082\u3053\u306e\u30d7\u30e9\u30c3\u30c8\u30d5\u30a9\u30fc\u30e0\u5411\u3051\u306b\u958b\u767a\u3067\u304d\u307e\u3059\u3002\u591a\u304f\u306e MiSTer \u30b3\u30a2\u306f\u3001<strong>\u30d5\u30ec\u30fc\u30e0\u30ef\u30fc\u30af</strong>\u3068\u547c\u3070\u308c\u308b\u5171\u901a\u306e\u307b\u307c\u540c\u4e00\u306e\u30b3\u30fc\u30c9\u30d6\u30ed\u30c3\u30af\u3092\u5171\u6709\u3057\u3066\u304a\u308a\u3001\u30cf\u30fc\u30c9\u30a6\u30a7\u30a2\u3068\u30d5\u30a1\u30fc\u30e0\u30a6\u30a7...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/developer/porting.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:37:39+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/developer/principles/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/developer/principles/", "title": "\u30b3\u30a2\u958b\u767a\u30ac\u30a4\u30c9\u30e9\u30a4\u30f3", "content_html": "<p>MiSTer \u30d7\u30ed\u30b8\u30a7\u30af\u30c8\u3078\u306e\u30b3\u30f3\u30c8\u30ea\u30d3\u30e5\u30fc\u30c8\u306e\u305f\u3081\u306e\u30d2\u30f3\u30c8\u3068\u30ac\u30a4\u30c9\u30e9\u30a4\u30f3\u3002</p>\n<h2>\u30a4\u30f3\u30c7\u30f3\u30c8\u306f\u30b9\u30da\u30fc\u30b9\u3067\u306f\u306a\u304f\u30bf\u30d6\u3067</h2>\n<p>\u30d7\u30ed\u30b8\u30a7\u30af\u30c8\u306e\u898f\u7d04\u306f\u30bf\u30d6\u3067\u3059\u3002diff \u304c\u304d\u308c\u3044\u306b\u306a\u308b\u3088\u3046\u3001\u65e2\u5b58\u30d5\u30a1\u30a4\u30eb\u3068\u4e00\u8cab\u3057\u305f\u30a4\u30f3\u30c7\u30f3\u30c8\u3092\u4fdd\u3063\u3066\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002</p>\n<h2>\u9069\u5207\u306a\u5834\u6240\u3067\u30b3\u30fc\u30c9\u306b\u30b3\u30e1\u30f3\u30c8\u3059\u308b</h2>\n<p>\u30b3\u30e1\u30f3\u30c8\u3092\u66f8\u304f\u306e\u306f\u4f59\u5206\u306a\u6642\u9593\u304c\u304b\u304b...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/developer/principles.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:37:39+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/basics/bluetooth/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/basics/bluetooth/", "title": "Bluetooth", "content_html": "<p>The MiSTer supports Bluetooth adapters and Bluetooth-connected controllers.</p>\n<h2>Compatible adapters</h2>\n<p>Generally speaking, most Bluetooth 4.0 adapters use one ...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/basics/bluetooth.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:36:49+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/basics/cd/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/basics/cd/", "title": "CD-based ROMs", "content_html": "<p>CD image format support depends on the core. CUE/BIN and CHD are common, but some cores also accept ISO or other formats. Check the core's readme for the sup...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/basics/cd.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:36:49+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/features/rtcsupport/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/features/rtcsupport/", "title": "RTC Support", "content_html": "<p>MiSTer has Real-Time Clock support in many of its cores. If the MiSTer has time set correctly \u2014 via network time sync or an RTC board \u2014 these cores will show...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/cores/features/rtcsupport.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:36:49+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/highlights/psx/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/highlights/psx/", "title": "PSX", "content_html": "<p>The Sony PlayStation (PSX) MiSTer core:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Multiple controller options</li>\n<li>Automatic BIOS region swapping</li>\n<li>Both memory card slots with manual file loading</li>\n<li>S...</li>\n</ul>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/cores/highlights/psx.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:36:49+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/highlights/saturn/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/highlights/saturn/", "title": "Saturn", "content_html": "<p>The Sega Saturn MiSTer core, originally developed by <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/srg320/\">srg320 (Sergey Dvodnenko)</a>{target=_blank}, reproduces the original har...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/cores/highlights/saturn.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:36:49+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/highlights/snes/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/highlights/snes/", "title": "SNES", "content_html": "<p>The Super Nintendo Entertainment System (SNES) MiSTer core has many features, such as CPU and Super FX turbo modes, lightgun and mouse support, and a configu...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/cores/highlights/snes.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:36:49+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/basics/bluetooth/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/basics/bluetooth/", "title": "Bluetooth", "content_html": "<p>MiSTer \u306f Bluetooth \u30a2\u30c0\u30d7\u30bf\u30fc\u3068 Bluetooth \u63a5\u7d9a\u306e\u30b3\u30f3\u30c8\u30ed\u30fc\u30e9\u30fc\u306b\u5bfe\u5fdc\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002</p>\n<h2>\u5bfe\u5fdc\u30a2\u30c0\u30d7\u30bf\u30fc</h2>\n<p>\u4e00\u822c\u7684\u306b\u3001Bluetooth 4.0 \u30a2\u30c0\u30d7\u30bf\u30fc\u306e\u591a\u304f\u306f CSR8510 \u307e\u305f\u306f BCM20702 \u3068\u3044\u3046\u4f3c\u305f\u30c1\u30c3\u30d7\u306e\u3069\u3061\u3089\u304b\u3092\u4f7f\u3063\u3066\u304a\u308a\u3001\u3069\u3061\u3089\u3082\u5bfe\u5fdc\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002Blueto...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/basics/bluetooth.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:36:49+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/basics/cd/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/basics/cd/", "title": "CD\u30d9\u30fc\u30b9\u306eROM", "content_html": "<p>CD \u30a4\u30e1\u30fc\u30b8\u306e\u5bfe\u5fdc\u30d5\u30a9\u30fc\u30de\u30c3\u30c8\u306f\u30b3\u30a2\u306b\u3088\u3063\u3066\u7570\u306a\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002CUE/BIN \u3068 CHD \u304c\u4e00\u822c\u7684\u3067\u3059\u304c\u3001ISO \u306a\u3069\u4ed6\u306e\u5f62\u5f0f\u3092\u53d7\u3051\u4ed8\u3051\u308b\u30b3\u30a2\u3082\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002\u5bfe\u5fdc\u30d5\u30a9\u30fc\u30de\u30c3\u30c8\u306f\u30b3\u30a2\u306e readme \u3092\u78ba\u8a8d\u3057\u3066\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002\u3053\u306e\u30da\u30fc\u30b8\u3067\u306f CD \u30a4\u30e1\u30fc\u30b8\u306e\u683c\u7d0d\u65b9\u6cd5\u3068\u3001USB CD \u30c9\u30e9\u30a4\u30d6\u306b\u5bfe\u5fdc\u3059\u308b\u304b\u3069\u3046\u304b\u3092\u8aac\u660e\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002</p>\n<h1>...</h1>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/basics/cd.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:36:49+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/cores/features/rtcsupport/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/cores/features/rtcsupport/", "title": "RTC\u5bfe\u5fdc", "content_html": "<p>MiSTer \u306e\u591a\u304f\u306e\u30b3\u30a2\u306f\u30ea\u30a2\u30eb\u30bf\u30a4\u30e0\u30af\u30ed\u30c3\u30af\uff08RTC\uff09\u306b\u5bfe\u5fdc\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002\u30cd\u30c3\u30c8\u30ef\u30fc\u30af\u6642\u523b\u540c\u671f\u307e\u305f\u306f RTC \u30dc\u30fc\u30c9\u3067\u6642\u523b\u304c\u6b63\u3057\u304f\u8a2d\u5b9a\u3055\u308c\u3066\u3044\u308c\u3070\u3001\u3053\u308c\u3089\u306e\u30b3\u30a2\u306f\u6b63\u3057\u3044\u65e5\u6642\u3092\u8868\u793a\u30fb\u5229\u7528\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\u4ee5\u4e0b\u306e\u30b3\u30a2\u30ea\u30b9\u30c8\u306f\u30b9\u30ca\u30c3\u30d7\u30b7\u30e7\u30c3\u30c8\u3067\u3001\u6700\u65b0\u30ea\u30ea\u30fc\u30b9\u306b\u9045\u308c\u308b\u3053\u3068\u304c\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002\u5404\u30b3\u30a2\u306e README \u3092\u78ba\u8a8d\u3057\u3066\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002\n...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/cores/features/rtcsupport.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:36:49+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/cores/highlights/psx/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/cores/highlights/psx/", "title": "PSX", "content_html": "<p>Sony PlayStation\uff08PSX\uff09\u306e MiSTer \u30b3\u30a2\uff1a</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\u8c4a\u5bcc\u306a\u30b3\u30f3\u30c8\u30ed\u30fc\u30e9\u30fc\u30aa\u30d7\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3</li>\n<li>BIOS \u30ea\u30fc\u30b8\u30e7\u30f3\u306e\u81ea\u52d5\u5207\u308a\u66ff\u3048</li>\n<li>\u624b\u52d5\u30d5\u30a1\u30a4\u30eb\u8aad\u307f\u8fbc\u307f\u306b\u5bfe\u5fdc\u3057\u305f\u30e1\u30e2\u30ea\u30fc\u30ab\u30fc\u30c92\u30b9\u30ed\u30c3\u30c8</li>\n<li>\u9ad8\u901f\u5316\u30e2\u30fc\u30c9</li>\n<li>\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u5185\u30c6\u30af\u30b9\u30c1\u30e3\u5909\u66f4</li>\n</ul>\n<p>PSX \u306e FPGA \u5b9f\u88c5\u3092\u66f8\u304f\u306e\u306f\u5927\u5909\u306a\u4f5c\u696d\u3067\u3001Rober...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/cores/highlights/psx.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:36:49+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/cores/highlights/saturn/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/cores/highlights/saturn/", "title": "Saturn", "content_html": "<p>Sega Saturn \u306e MiSTer \u30b3\u30a2\u306f\u3001<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/srg320/\">srg320 (Sergey Dvodnenko)</a>{target=_blank} \u6c0f\u304c\u958b\u767a\u3092\u59cb\u3081\u305f\u3082\u306e\u3067\u3001Sega Saturn \u30e9\u30a4\u30d6\u30e9\u30ea\u30fc\u306e\u5927\u90e8\u5206\u3067\u5b9f\u6a5f\u3092\u518d\u73fe\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002</p>\n<h2>\u30b3\u30f3\u30c8\u30ed\u30fc\u30e9\u30fc...</h2>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/cores/highlights/saturn.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:36:49+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/cores/highlights/snes/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/cores/highlights/snes/", "title": "SNES", "content_html": "<p>Super Nintendo Entertainment System\uff08SNES\uff09\u306e MiSTer \u30b3\u30a2\u306b\u306f\u591a\u304f\u306e\u6a5f\u80fd\u304c\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002CPU \u3068 Super FX \u306e\u30bf\u30fc\u30dc\u30e2\u30fc\u30c9\u3001\u30e9\u30a4\u30c8\u30ac\u30f3\u30fb\u30de\u30a6\u30b9\u5bfe\u5fdc\u3001\u8a2d\u5b9a\u53ef\u80fd\u306a WRAM \u521d\u671f\u5316\u5024\u306a\u3069\u3067\u3059\u3002\u30b3\u30f3\u30bd\u30fc\u30eb\u5411\u3051\u306b\u30ea\u30ea\u30fc\u30b9\u3055\u308c\u305f\u591a\u304f\u306e\u62e1\u5f35\u30c1\u30c3\u30d7\u306b\u5bfe\u5fdc\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002\u3053\u306e\u975e\u5e38\u306b...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/cores/highlights/snes.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:36:49+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}]}